{
  "content": "<h1 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"StartingBalances CapitalAccounts\">Starting Balances — Capital Accounts</h1>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"CapitalAccounts NewStartingBalance\">This screen allows you to set up starting balances for your capital accounts that you have created under the <strong>Capital Accounts</strong> tab. To create a new starting balance for a capital account, click the <strong>New Starting Balance</strong> button.</p>\n<p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"StartingBalances CapitalAccounts\"><div><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg dark:bg-slate-800 dark:border-slate-700 dark:shadow-none flex space-x-4 rtl:space-x-reverse shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 dark:text-gray-400 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CapitalAccounts\">CapitalAccounts</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewStartingBalance\">NewStartingBalance</span></span></div></div></div></p>\n<p translate=\"true\">You will be taken to the <strong>Starting Balance</strong> screen for the capital account. See <a href=\"guides/starting-balance-for-capital-account-form\">Starting Balance for Capital Account Form</a> for more information.</p>\n",
  "key": "starting-balance-for-capital-account-list"
}
